  <!-- [2026-07-29 split] Original SensoryOverload mixed vision (Sight/Eye) and hearing (Hearing/Ear),
       but a Hediff can only attach to one body part, causing anatomical mismatch like "attached to eye but reducing hearing".
       Split into two independent Hediffs, each attached to the corresponding organ and only modifying the corresponding capacity. -->

